  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of the project is to strengthen the capacities of the Ministry of Foreign and European Affairs of Slovakia in the field of development cooperation. The project focuses primarily on knowledge and skills related to programmatic and strategic tools for providing effective and high-quality ODA to its partners, managerial skills, including specific financial tools and so on.</narrative>
